" a successful 802.1x connection. 802.1x credentials are reused on the portal"
" to match an authentication and get the appropriate actions. As a security "
"precaution, this option will only reuse 802.1x credentials if there is an "
"authentication source matching the provided realm. This means, if users use "
"802.1x credentials with a domain part (username@domain, domain\\username), "
"the domain part needs to be configured as a realm under the RADIUS section "
"and an authentication source needs to be configured for that realm. If users"
" do not use 802.1x credentials with a domain part, only the NULL realm will "
"be match IF an authentication source is configured for it."
